                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Certainly not the worst game I`ve ever played but a long way from being worth a purchase. \nSingle player works but doesn`t have much in the way of variety with seemingly only the one level you replay over and over and some randomisation to the blocks while Multiplayer and leaderboards seem to be offline. Better scores unlock more cutomisable stuff for your character though it hardly matters.\nIt`s not a bad concept, a tetrisy bubbles thing but this is really only a start of a game that needed more levels, power ups, game modes, polish and a lot of everything inbetween. Graphics are ok for the most part but the music is fairly lacklustre.",
